<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech Fin Min bond average gross YTM 12.21 pct.</title>
<headline>Czech Fin Min bond average gross YTM 12.21 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Average gross yield to maturity in a Finance Ministry five year bond auction on Monday was 12.21 percent, the Czech National Bank said on Monday.</p>
<p>The central bank said 4.998 billion crowns were raised in the five billion crown auction. The total amount of bids was 9.95 billion crowns.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
